  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Strategim&#xf6;ten BIH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stretegy meeting BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida har best&#xe4;mt sig f&#xf6;r att inkludera tv&#xe5; lokala referensgrupper i landstrategiprocessen f&#xf6;r Bosnien och Hercegovina. En grupp skall representera det civila samh&#xe4;llet och en de bosniska myndigheterna. Meningen &#xe4;r, att denna process skall &#xf6;ka det lokala &#xe4;gandeskapet av den nya landstrategin. Kostnaderna f&#xf6;r gruppen representerande det civila samh&#xe4;llet m&#xe5;ste t&#xe4;ckas av Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has decided that the process for elaborating a new country strategy for Bosnia and Herzegovina shall include three meetings with two Bosnian reference groups, one representing the civil society and one representing the Bosnian authorities. The costs for convening these groups (since some of the civil society representatives will have to travel to Sarajevo) is estimated at KM 500 per meeting.</narrative>
  </description>
